{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-phone-tracker-lib-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-lib","refs":["F-phone-1127"],"severity":"S4","title":"'Saved as a routine' can say it went to 'My routines' when it went to 'Other routines'","what":"When a member saves a workout as a routine without picking a folder, the message says 'It is in My routines'. But when the plan the member follows is itself an older folder called 'My Routines', the app puts the new routine in a folder called 'Other routines' instead, so the member looks in the wrong folder.","expected":"The message names the folder the routine really went to.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/lib/useWorkoutActions.ts:133-137","apps/mobile/src/tracker/db/routineRepo.ts:105","apps/mobile/src/tracker/db/folderRepo.ts:425-436"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"saved-message-guesses-folder-name","who":"members with an older followed plan named My Routines","how_often":"every save as routine with no folder picked, for those members","fix_line":"Show the name of the folder the routine was saved into, read back after saving","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-phone-tracker-lib-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-lib","refs":["F-phone-1115","P-A7-whats-new-3-24"],"severity":"S4","title":"The In use tick says 'after every set', but it never opens after an exercise's last set","what":"The tick on the In use screen reads 'Show after every set of this exercise' and the line under the rest clock says 'In use opens after each set'. By the owner's rule the screen does not open by itself after the last working set of an exercise (or after warm-ups and drop sets), so a member who ticked it sees it missing after the last set and may think it broke.","expected":"The words match the rule, for example 'Show after each set, except the last'.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/lib/inUse.ts:11","apps/mobile/src/tracker/lib/inUse.ts:20","apps/mobile/src/tracker/lib/inUse.ts:204-212"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"in-use-words-skip-last-set","who":"members who use the In use screen","how_often":"once per exercise in every workout","fix_line":"Change the tick and clock lines to say it opens between sets, not after the last one","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
